        "block_index": 42,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Give What to Expect's new baby tracker a try, and let us help you organize your little one's feedings, diaper changes, sleep, and more, along with your pumping sessions, so that you don't have to. You'll be able to enjoy that special bonding time with your baby with less worry! You can download the free What to Expect app (and use its baby tracker) for iPhone , iPad , and Android .",
